+
+  **Acceptance predicate**: Duplicate delivery, persistence failure, and recovery/retry assertions fail until migration, persistence, signature, service, and callback-route work are complete.
+
+  **Test command**: `npm test -- tests/integration/reminder-callback-delivery.test.ts`
+
+  **File**: `tests/integration/reminder-callback-delivery.test.ts`
